{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:f9369e69bc2b8ff5","name":"Derriphan-Class Battleship","source":{"id":"source:reference-f9369e69bc2b8ff5","title":"Derriphan-Class Battleship","revision":19104,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T21:19:26Z","sha256":"8e9bb1ca394024f724c3a06bae5849f3c7aaf86a502063e37b2d212f46fc4bb0","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=19104","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Derriphan-Class%20Battleship&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-f9369e69bc2b8ff5","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Knights of the Old Republic Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Knights_of_the_Old_Republic_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Affiliations: ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Sith Empire"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Sith_Empire","referenceId":"reference:303e4cc32aa1a8e1"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["One of the staples of the Sith Fleet a thousand years before ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Great Sith War"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Great_Sith_War"},", the 215-meter-long ",{"tag":"i","children":["Derriphan"]},"-Class Battleship is a well-armored frigate that is capable of dealing significant amounts of damage to enemy forces. Despite being unshielded and sluggish, the ",{"tag":"i","children":["Derriphan"]},"-Class Battleship can still take a beating as it concentrates its fire on individual enemy ships. Since this Battleship carries only a small complement of six ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starfighters"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starfighters","referenceId":"reference:e127af2636e147fc"},", it relies on its ",{"tag":"a","children":["Point-Defense Weapons"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Point-Defense_Weapons"}," for most of its anti-fighter protection.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Though all of the ",{"tag":"i","children":["Derriphan"]},"-Class Battleships were thought to be destroyed in ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Great Hyperspace War"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Great_Hyperspace_War?action=edit&redlink=1"},", at least one survived. The ship, belonging to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Naga Sadow"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Naga_Sadow?action=edit&redlink=1"},", was buried on ",{"tag":"a","children":["Yavin 4"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Yavin_4","referenceId":"reference:5f008a1b1f754b64"},". During ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Great Sith War"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Great_Sith_War"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Exar Kun"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Exar_Kun","referenceId":"reference:ecc01bec6de14936"}," would raise the ship from the planet and put it back into service, similar to the way that ",{"tag":"a","children":["Darth Nihilus"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Darth_Nihilus","referenceId":"reference:0f4fcd6fb21229ce"}," would raise The ",{"tag":"i","children":["Ravager"]}," from the ruined surface of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Malachor V"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Malachor_V","referenceId":"reference:c62c91d1302bb9b2"},". Though Shadow's ship, under Exar Kun's control, would eventually be destroyed at the conclusion of the war, knowledge of the ship's construction is handed down to a small number of Sith exiles who keep the secret of the ship's design.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["When ",{"tag":"a","children":["Darth Revan"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Darth_Revan"}," and ",{"tag":"a","children":["Darth Malak"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Darth_Malak","referenceId":"reference:9428775bff11dbd6"}," return from ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Unknown Regions"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Unknown_Regions"}," and resurrect ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Sith Empire"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Sith_Empire","referenceId":"reference:303e4cc32aa1a8e1"},", the exiles in possession of the plans for the ",{"tag":"i","children":["Derriphan"]},"-Class Battleship turn the information over to Revan's forces. In need of smaller ",{"tag":"a","children":["Capital Ships"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Capital_Ships","referenceId":"reference:a08d2e2cd508d403"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Sith Empire"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Sith_Empire","referenceId":"reference:303e4cc32aa1a8e1"}," uses ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Star Forge"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Star_Forge"}," to quickly construct dozens of ",{"tag":"i","children":["Derriphan"]},"-Class Battleships. More powerful than analogous frigates under Republic control, these ships prove to be an excellent complement to the larger ",{"tag":"a","children":["Capital Ships"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Capital_Ships","referenceId":"reference:a08d2e2cd508d403"}," in the Sith Fleet, though their lack of shielding results in heavy casualties among this class of ship.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h4","children":["Default (Skilled)"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Derriphan"]},"-Class Battleship Statistics (CL 14)"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Colossal (Frigate) ",{"tag":"a","children":["Capital Ship"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Capital_Ship"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Initiative"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Initiative","referenceId":"reference:3e687de48a6ad4e5"},":"]}," -4; ",{"tag":"b","children":["Senses:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Perception"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Perception","referenceId":"reference:bd18e320a6bb9f53"}," +6\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Defenses"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Reflex Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reflex_Defense"},": 13 (",{"tag":"a","children":["Flat-Footed"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Flat-Footed"},": 13), ",{"tag":"a","children":["Fortitud